<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-LATEST FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LATEST FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results on the</p>
<p>second day of the French Open tennis tournament on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>2-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat Paola Suarez (Argentina)  6-1 6-4</p>
<p>15-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Olga  Barabanschikova</p>
<p>(Belarus) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>14-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Lenka Cenkova</p>
<p>(Czech Republic) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Lenka Nemeckova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Rene Simpson (Canada) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Virginia Ruano-Pascual (Spain) beat Angeles Montolio (Spain)</p>
<p>6-0 6-0</p>
</text>
